{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f7d6cfba-b51e-8d59-aeaf-9ee0cae08fe4",
  "created_at": "2026-01-15T11:14:43-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yusuf Mensah",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:09:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:09:12-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. My name is Yusuf Mensah. I am calling about some trash that was left at the curb. Bulk waste, I think you call it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:09:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, okay. Bulk waste at the curb. Where is this, Mr. Mensah?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:09:30-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The address is two, zero, three Malbone Road. In the North End. I am the renter there, on the ground floor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:09:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two oh three Malbone Road. Got it. And what's out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:09:44-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My landlord had a tenant move out of the upstairs unit. Last weekend. And he put everything on the curb. A mattress, a box spring, two chairs, a broken table, and some bags. It is all still sitting there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:10:00-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, mattress, box spring, chairs, table, bags. Did he schedule a pickup for it, do you know? Bulk items usually need to be set up ahead of time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:10:12-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not know. I do not think so. He did not say anything to me. He just put it out and left. [pause] Excuse me one moment. I dropped something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:10:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:10:28-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry. It is a coin. I was practicing while I waited for you to pick up. I am an amateur magician, you see. Coin tricks. And now the coin has gone under the radiator. [pause] Well, that part is not a trick."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:10:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Well, hopefully it turns up. So, the stuff at the curb. Has the regular trash truck come by since?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:10:54-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It came Tuesday. They took the regular bags and the bins. But they left the furniture and the mattress."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:11:03-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that tracks. Regular crews don't take bulk items unless it's been arranged. So it's probably going to sit there until somebody sets it up. Is it blocking the sidewalk at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:11:17-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Partly. The table is on the sidewalk. A person with a stroller would have to go into the street. And with the snow on the ground, it is not so good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:11:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that's worth noting. I'll put that down. Sidewalk partly blocked, at two oh three Malbone Road. And you're the tenant, not the owner, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:11:41-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. I am only the tenant. The owner is my landlord. I do not want to get in trouble with him. But I also do not want a fine to come to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:11:55-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Generally the property owner is the one responsible for it, so I'd not worry about you. But I can't promise how enforcement will handle it. That's something a supervisor would be better to speak to."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:12:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That is what I wish to ask. Could a supervisor call me back? I would like to hear what they will do, and when."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:12:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can put in that request. Let me grab your number. Is it the one I'm seeing on the screen, or a different one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:12:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am on a different phone, so I will give it to you. It is four, zero, one. [pause] Five, five, five. [pause] Zero, one, eight, two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:12:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one eight two. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:12:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:12:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And you said your name is Yusuf Mensah. Could you spell the last name for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:13:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. M, E, N, S, A, H."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:13:05-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "M-E-N-S-A-H. Perfect. So I've got a callback request for a supervisor, about bulk waste left at the curb at two oh three Malbone Road after a move-out, partly blocking the sidewalk. Anything else I should add?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:13:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Only that the landlord did not arrange it, as far as I know. And that it has been there since Saturday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:13:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since Saturday. Okay, adding that. Is there a time that's better for the call? Mornings, afternoons?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:13:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Afternoons are better. After one o'clock. In the morning I go to the senior center, and my phone is quiet there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:13:45-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Afternoons after one. Got it. I can't tell you exactly when they'll get to it, but I'll flag it for today if they're in. Otherwise it might be tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:13:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is fine. Tomorrow is fine. I will be home."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:14:02-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. And in the meantime, if the landlord does want to get it picked up properly, he can call us and set up a bulk pickup. You can pass that along if you want."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:14:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I will tell him. He may not like it, but I will tell him."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:14:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Anything else I can help you with this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:14:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you, Kevin. I will wait for the call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:14:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it, Mr. Mensah. Have a good day, and good luck finding that coin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:14:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
